[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物を退治するところ、見たいから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanna watch you fight monsters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見たいからって……ナナ、お前は稼働して、この\n地に来て間もない。まだ「管理」の仕事をするには早い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You want to watch...? Nana, you've only just been activated. It's too early for you to be involved in management duties."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、邪魔しないから。\n見てるだけだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I won't get in the way. I'll just watch. Promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐ……そうやってお願いされると弱い……\nいいか、しっかり隠れてるんだぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... when you ask like that, I can't say no... Fine, but you have to stay hidden!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いざとなれば、私もやる……ふっふっふ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If things get bad, I'll join in... Hehehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ナナ、今回は聞き逃してやるが、\n次はないからな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana, I'll let it slide this time, but there won't be a next time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah!"
        }
