  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ギャンッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ROAR!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "魔物",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monster"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（調整中とはいえなんという強さ……\n\u3000これに加えて調合機能も有しているのか……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She possesses such incredible strength even though she's not fully calibrated yet... And she has synthesis capabilities on top of this...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……あったかい……これ、血？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... it's warm... Is this blood?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、私が……倒した、の？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did I... kill it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（何を惚けている！\u3000いくら強くてもナナは初陣で、\n\u3000初めて命を奪って……妹なんだぞ！！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What am I doing standing here dazed?! No matter how strong she is, this is Nana's first battle, her first time taking a life... She's my little sister!!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ……ナナ、よくやった。怖かったな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right... Nana, you did great. You must have been scared..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "怖い……？\u3000これ、私、怖いの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Scared...? Am I scared?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫、大丈夫だ……ナナのことは守ってやる。\nお兄ちゃんが、全部守ってやるからな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's okay, it's okay... I'll protect you, Nana. Your big brother will protect you from everything..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ぐるるる……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Growwwwwl..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（なんだ？\u3000この音？\u3000魔物の残党か？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What's that sound? More monsters?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お腹、減った",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm hungry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "腹の音！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was your stomach?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いや……悲しくても苦しくても腹は減るものだ。\nむしろ食欲があるなら大丈夫だ。何を食べたい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I guess it makes sense... even if you're sad or hurting, you'd still get hungry. Actually, having an appetite probably means you're fine. What do you want to eat?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ハンバーグ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hamburger..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ナナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "また肉々しいものを……いや、分かった。\nお兄ちゃんが美味しいハンバーグを作ってやるからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Again with the meat... Well, I got it. Your big brother will fix you up a delicious hamburger."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（強くても、不安定で、食いしん坊な妹なんだ。\n\u3000私が、しっかり守ってやらなくちゃな……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's strong, but unstable and has quite the appetite. I really need to look after her properly...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  }
